---
/**
 * The site is dark only. Starlight renders `data-theme="dark"` on <html>; there is nothing to read from
 * storage, so there is no theme flash when a page loads or the client router swaps it.
 */
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "dark";
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
